        "class": "contents"
      },
      "html": "<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"smartrent-hero\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto gap-8 pb-24 max-md:pb-12 section-shell--nav-clearance section-shell--nav-clearance-with-padding section-shell--fluid-mobile-padding\" style=\"--section-shell-padding-top:13rem;--section-shell-padding-top-mobile:6rem;\"><img src=\"/content-media/work/smartrent/smartrent-logo.svg\" alt=\"SmartRent\" width=\"304\" height=\"40\" class=\"smartrent-case-logo\" decoding=\"async\"><h1 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-5xl max-md:leading-none max-md:tracking-display text-6xl\"><span class=\"block text-spark\">SmartRent</span><span class=\"block text-slatecolor\">AI search. Real pipeline.</span></h1></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"smartrent-overview\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-6 max-md:py-4\" ><div class=\"bw-dashboard\" aria-label=\"SmartRent animated AI search results\">\n <div class=\"bw-dashboard-header\"><div><h2 class=\"bw-dashboard-heading\">SmartRent · AI search results</h2><p class=\"bw-dashboard-period\">30-day visibility snapshot</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"bw-dashboard-replay\" data-bw-replay hidden aria-label=\"Replay SmartRent results animation\">Replay</button></div>\n <div class=\"bw-dashboard-grid\">\n  <article class=\"bw-dashboard-card bw-traffic-card\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"smartrent-aio-title\">\n   <h3 id=\"smartrent-aio-title\">Google AI Overviews</h3>\n   <p class=\"bw-figure bw-traffic-figure\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">96</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"96\" data-bw-counter-from=\"64\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">96</span></span><em aria-hidden=\"true\">citations</em></p>\n   <p class=\"bw-card-description\">A 50% increase from the starting point</p>\n   <div class=\"bw-traffic-plot\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Google AI Overviews citations increased from 64 to 96, a 50 percent increase. Bars share the same scale.\">\n    <div class=\"bw-plot-column\"><div class=\"bw-plot-track\"><div class=\"bw-plot-bar bw-plot-bar--before bw-plot-bar--smartrent-before\" data-bw-bar=\"vertical\"></div></div><p class=\"bw-plot-value\">64</p><p class=\"bw-plot-label\">Before</p></div>\n    <div class=\"bw-plot-column\"><div class=\"bw-plot-track\"><div class=\"bw-plot-bar bw-plot-bar--after\" data-bw-bar=\"vertical\"></div></div><p class=\"bw-plot-value\">96</p><p class=\"bw-plot-label\">After</p></div>\n   </div>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"bw-dashboard-card bw-maps-card\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"smartrent-citations-title\">\n   <h3 id=\"smartrent-citations-title\">New AI citations</h3><p class=\"bw-figure\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">136</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"136\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">136</span></span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">Additional citations across AI platforms</p><p class=\"bw-rank-note\">In just 30 days.</p>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"bw-dashboard-card bw-keywords-card bw-leads-card\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"smartrent-leads-title\">\n   <h3 id=\"smartrent-leads-title\">Qualified opportunities</h3><p class=\"bw-figure bw-traffic-figure\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">10</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"10\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">10</span></span><em aria-hidden=\"true\">per month</em></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">Sales-qualified leads from LLMs</p>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"bw-dashboard-card bw-authority-card bw-value-card\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"smartrent-value-title\">\n   <h3 id=\"smartrent-value-title\">Opportunity value</h3><p class=\"bw-figure\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">Approximately $126,000</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"bw-currency-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$</span><span data-bw-counter=\"126\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">126</span>k</span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">Approximate value associated with the qualified leads</p>\n  </article>\n </div>\n</div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"smartrent-intro\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">At Fyntix, we helped SmartRent improve AI visibility through technical SEO, clearer answers and content aligned with commercial searches.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">For us, a useful search programme connects discovery with a business decision. A potential customer should be able to find a relevant answer, understand the offer and decide whether to start a conversation. That gives each improvement a purpose beyond simply making a dashboard look busier.</p></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"smartrent-challenge\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">The challenge</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\"><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">Indexation problems, unnecessary redirects, weak page performance and unclear content structure were limiting SmartRent’s visibility.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">A website can contain the information a buyer needs and still be difficult to discover. The first question is whether a search engine can reach and understand the relevant page. The next is whether that page helps someone make progress. Improving one side while overlooking the other leaves a gap between being found and being useful.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">For Google’s AI search features, the foundation is still sound SEO. <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/appearance/ai-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2\">Google’s guidance</a> explains that a supporting page must be indexed and eligible to appear in Search with a snippet. Eligibility creates an opportunity to appear; it does not guarantee a citation.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"smartrent-approach\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">Our approach</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\"><h3 class=\"mt-6 mb-3 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">Make the foundations work</h3><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">We audited technical issues, addressed indexation and redirects, and worked on Core Web Vitals.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\"><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/appearance/core-web-vitals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2\">Core Web Vitals</a> describe loading performance, responsiveness and visual stability. Those are practical concerns for someone trying to evaluate a solution: can they read the page promptly, interact with it comfortably and keep their place as it loads? A more usable site supports the visit after the search click as well as the discovery before it.</p><h3 class=\"mt-6 mb-3 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">Make the answers clearer</h3><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">We added FAQs and transactional content, then refined keyword mapping, page titles and descriptions.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">Clear answers give a reader a useful starting point, while the rest of the page supplies the detail needed to judge the offer. A heading should explain what follows. A direct answer should make sense in context. This is also why an FAQ works best as part of a helpful page, with language a prospective customer would recognise.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">Google does not require a separate set of special optimisations for AI Overviews. Its recommendations include allowing crawling, making pages discoverable through internal links and keeping important information available as text. Search and AI visibility therefore share a substantial foundation; treating them together keeps the content useful across both experiences.</p><h3 class=\"mt-6 mb-3 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">Build context beyond the website</h3><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">Our outreach focused on relevant solution roundups and citation opportunities.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">Third-party context gives a buyer another place to encounter and compare an offer. Relevance matters more than collecting mentions for their own sake. The useful question is whether a placement helps someone researching that category understand why a solution belongs in their consideration set.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"smartrent-impact\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">The impact</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\"><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">Within 30 days, SmartRent added 136 AI citations. Google AI Overviews citations rose from 64 to 96. The programme generated 10 monthly sales-qualified leads, associated with approximately $126,000 in opportunity value.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">These figures answer different questions. A citation shows that information is being referenced. A qualified lead shows that a conversation has reached a more meaningful stage for sales. Opportunity value describes potential business rather than a completed sale. Keeping those measures distinct makes the result easier to interpret and helps a team choose what to improve next.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"smartrent-cta\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col items-start gap-6\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight text-4xl text-slatecolor\">Let’s turn search into growth.</h2><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-charcoal px-6 py-3 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight text-chalk\">Talk to Fyntix</a></div></section></div>"
    },
